        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>On this page: http://sentinelsdigital.com/variants.html<br /><br />You can read the following phrase: &quot;30 days after first release, each Variant will also have a password posted here that will automatically unlock that Variant in-game. However, using this password to unlock a Variant will not fulfill any related achievement once those are added to the game.&quot;<br /><br />Are characters that we&#39;ve unlocked legitimately already being tracked? I really don&#39;t want to have to do Cosmic Omnitron&#39;s or Dark Watch Mr. Fixer&#39;s unlock conditions again.</p>",
