        "created_at": "2015-04-16T23:55:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had unlocked everything legit before, but when installing Rook City I wound up uninstalling and reinstalling, losing my unlocks in the process. So I went in and used the codes for the core-game variants.</p><p>Then later, I managed to accidentally put 5+ Bursts in the Trash in one turn, and I \"unlocked\" SS Tachyon. Which was funny, because I used SS Tachyon to unlock herself!</p><p>Comics, everyone! :)</p>",
